# Sync with Images (Replace Mode)

::: {display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 2em; align-items: start}

```python [highlight:line-by-line]
data = load_data()
cleaned = process(data)
result = analyze(cleaned)
```

:::[sync-fragments]
![Raw Data](https://placehold.co/400x200/3498db/white?text=Raw+Data)
[---]
![Cleaned](https://placehold.co/400x200/2ecc71/white?text=Cleaned)
[---]
![Results](https://placehold.co/400x200/e74c3c/white?text=Results)
:::[sync-fragments]

:::

===
# Sync Mixed Content (Keep Mode)

::: {display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 2em; align-items: start}

```java [highlight:line-by-line]
User user = new User("Bob");
user.setAge(30);
user.setRole("Admin");
System.out.println(user);
```

:::[sync-fragments keep]
User: name="Bob"
[---]
Updated: age=30
[---]
Updated: role="Admin"
[---]
![User Object](https://placehold.co/300x150/9b59b6/white?text=User+Object)
:::[sync-fragments]

:::

