===
# Sync with manual line numbers

::: {display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 2em; align-items: start}

```python [lines:'1|2|3-4']
def process():
    step1()
    step2()
    step3()
```

:::[sync-fragments keep]
Function defined
[---]
Step 1 executed
[---]
Steps 2 and 3 executed
:::[sync-fragments]

:::
